### Flow
```
Input: List<string>
    │
    └── Chunk into 20s (Graph batch limit)
            │
            ├── Batch 1: UPN direct lookup — all IDs in one HTTP request
            │       ├── ✅ Found → add to result
            │       └── ❌ 404  → move to fallback
            │
            └── Batch 2: Mail filter — only failed IDs (eventual consistency)
                    ├── ✅ Found → add to result
                    └── ❌ Not found → log + skip